Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Test Plugins|
		|portlet.plugins.includes|test-transaction-portlet|

Set Up: This executes before each scenario 
	Given User first Login PG

Tear Down: This executes after each scenario 
	Given Page tear Down PG

Scenario: View Transaction
Priority: 4
	Given Page add
		|pageName|Test Transaction Page|
	When Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Test Transaction|
	And AssertVisible at locator 'TestBlob#TEST_PORTLET_BODY_PASSED'
	Then AssertTextNotPresent the value 'FAILED'